 "html": "<img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/news/6a3c94db0c451.png\">\n<p>2026年 院生組職棋甄選-第二日，於7/2(四)在海峰棋院進行，經過四輪對戰，王亮勛、姬孝天、黃名棻、陳天宸、楊淞賁，五人三勝一負，暫時領先。</p>\n<p>詳細對戰成績如下:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/2026%E5%B9%B4%20%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8%20%E8%B3%BD%E7%A8%8B%E8%A1%A8.jpg\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Xhz_vCrPZabRw6aZyicbITl6UgoLrhDx2WhOhiRfikk/edit?usp=sharing\">2026 院生組 職棋甄選 - 成績表 (更新中)</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260702_27.jpg\"></p>\n<p>王亮勛</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260702_28.jpg\"></p>\n<p>姬孝天</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260702_22.jpg\"></p>\n<p>黃名棻</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260701_5.jpg\"></p>\n<p>陳天宸</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260702_31.jpg\"></p>\n<p>楊淞賁</p>"
